    <unit id="p1.4" at:kind="paragraph">
      <notes>
        <note category="location">Location: Body</note>
      </notes>
      <segment state="translated" subState="at:draft">
        <source>受甲方委托，乙方于2026年5月18日对北区变电站110 kV开关室的<pc id="1">主接地网</pc>进行了检测。实测接地电阻为0.42 Ω，<pc id="2">满足设计值0.5 Ω的要求</pc>。</source>
        <target>Commissioned by Party A, the Contractor tested the <pc id="1">main earth grid</pc> in the 110 kV switchgear room of the North District Substation on 18 May 2026. The measured earthing resistance was 0.42 Ω, <pc id="2">meeting the design value of 0.5 Ω</pc>.</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
